[en.IDEA_C12_SPECIAL_FROSTING]
Special Frosting

[en.IDEA_C12_SPECIAL_FROSTING_desc]
Cheap cooking ingredients were abundant everywhere, mixed in a unique way and supplemented with the magical earth pony magic. Large quantities of explosives were produced by the ton, loaded onto airships and cannons.

[zh.IDEA_C12_SPECIAL_FROSTING]
特制炸药

[zh.IDEA_C12_SPECIAL_FROSTING_desc]
随处可见的廉价烹饪材料，用一种特殊的方式混合，再辅以神奇的陆马魔法，大量的炸药被成吨的生产出来，装上飞艇和火炮。
